---
import Article from '../../research/laya-rlcd-system-one.md';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = 'Laya and RLCD: fast decisions for AI workflows';
const description = 'A technical explainer on Laya, typed decision models, RLCD training, calibrated confidence, and where fast structured decisions fit in AI systems.';
const hero = '/images/research/laya/laya-rlcd-system-one-hero.jpg';
---

<Layout title={`${pageTitle} · Latentsig AI Research`} description={description} image={hero} article>
  <div class="laya-article">
  <div class="reading-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span id="progress-bar"></span></div>
  <div class="research-page">
    <header class="hero">
      <img src={hero} alt="Unstructured signals passing through a decision core into three probability distributions" width="1672" height="941" loading="eager" />
      <div class="hero-wash"></div>
      <div class="hero-grid"></div>
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <a href="/insights/" class="back-link"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Insights</a>
          <div class="eyebrow-row"><span class="eyebrow">Systems explainer</span><span>12 min read</span></div>
          <h1>Laya and RLCD: <em>fast decisions for AI workflows</em></h1>
          <p>{description}</p>
          <div class="author-row"><span class="author-mark">λ</span><span><strong>Latentsig AI Research</strong><small>September 2026 · Architecture review</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="signal-strip" aria-label="Article summary">
      <div><span>01</span><strong>Bound the answer space.</strong><small>Typed questions turn a judgment into declared options and numeric outputs.</small></div>
      <div><span>02</span><strong>Batch encoder work.</strong><small>Each question gets a sequence; the runtime evaluates the sequences together.</small></div>
      <div><span>03</span><strong>Measure the probabilities.</strong><small>Calibration needs held-out data, thresholds, and continued monitoring.</small></div>
    </section>

    <div class="page-grid">
      <aside class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <span>On this page</span>
        <a href="#the-system-one-idea-with-a-careful-boundary">System One</a>
        <a href="#what-changes-for-builders">For builders</a>
        <a href="#what-enters-the-encoder">Encoder pipeline</a>
        <a href="#three-outputs-one-scoring-mechanism">Typed outputs</a>
        <a href="#reinforcement-learning-for-calibrated-decisions-rlcd">RLCD</a>
        <a href="#confidence-is-not-correctness">Confidence</a>
        <a href="#what-the-published-benchmarks-do-and-do-not-show">Benchmarks</a>
        <a href="#where-a-decision-model-fits">Workflow fit</a>
        <a href="#sources">Sources</a>
      </aside>
      <article class="article-body"><Article /></article>
    </div>

    <section class="closing">
      <span>Latentsig AI Systems</span>
      <h2>Test the decision before you automate the action.</h2>
      <p>We help teams evaluate model behavior, calibration, latency, and fallback design against real workflows.</p>
      <a href="/insights/">Explore more research <span>→</span></a>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script>
    const updateProgress = () => {
      const article = document.querySelector('.article-body');
      const bar = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#progress-bar');
      if (!article || !bar) return;
      const rect = article.getBoundingClientRect();
      const total = article.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
      const read = Math.min(Math.max(-rect.top, 0), total);
      bar.style.width = `${total > 0 ? (read / total) * 100 : 0}%`;
    };
    updateProgress();
    addEventListener('scroll', updateProgress, { passive: true });
  </script>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .laya-article{--bg:#08101f;--surface:#0d1729;--surface-2:#121d32;--line:#273149;--ink:#e8edff;--muted:#a6aec5;--violet:#a9abff;--violet-2:#7c80ff;--cyan:#86d2ff;--green:#8ddfc7;--amber:#ffb783;--serif:"Hanken Grotesk",sans-serif;--body:"Geist",sans-serif;--mono:"DM Mono",monospace;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.72 var(--body);text-rendering:optimizeLegibility}
  @scope (.laya-article){
  a{color:inherit}::selection{background:#8083ff;color:#090f20}
  .reading-progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:2px;z-index:1000}.reading-progress span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--violet-2),var(--green))}
  .hero{min-height:710px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#08101f}.hero>img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;filter:saturate(.9) contrast(1.03)}.hero-wash{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#08101f 0%,rgba(8,16,31,.96) 30%,rgba(8,16,31,.52) 65%,rgba(8,16,31,.15)),linear-gradient(0deg,#08101f 0%,transparent 48%)}.hero-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(160,170,200,.045) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(160,170,200,.045) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:40px 40px;mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000,transparent 75%)}.hero-inner{width:min(1280px,100%);margin:auto;padding:78px clamp(22px,5vw,72px) 88px;position:relative}.back-link{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:30px;color:#bac3d8;text-decoration:none;font:500 13px/1 var(--body)}.back-link:hover{color:var(--violet)}.eyebrow-row{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-bottom:24px;font:500 12px/1 var(--mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--muted)}.eyebrow{color:var(--violet);border-left:2px solid var(--violet-2);padding-left:10px}.hero h1{font:600 clamp(46px,5.4vw,75px)/1.03 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0;max-width:820px;text-wrap:balance}.hero h1 em{display:block;font-style:normal;color:var(--violet)}.hero-copy>p{max-width:700px;margin:28px 0 34px;color:#c6cde0;font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,21px);line-height:1.55}.author-row{display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center}.author-mark{width:40px;height:40px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(128,131,255,.16);border:1px solid rgba(128,131,255,.38);font:500 22px/1 var(--serif);color:var(--violet)}.author-row>span:last-child{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.author-row strong{font-size:14px}.author-row small{font:400 12px/1.5 var(--mono);color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
  .signal-strip{width:min(1280px,100%);margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);padding:0 clamp(22px,5vw,72px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.signal-strip>div{padding:34px 30px 36px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto auto;column-gap:10px}.signal-strip>div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:30px}.signal-strip span{grid-row:1/3;font:500 12px/1.3 var(--mono);color:var(--violet)}.signal-strip strong{font:600 15px/1.35 var(--serif)}.signal-strip small{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
  .page-grid{width:min(1280px,100%);margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,790px) 1fr;gap:64px;padding:90px clamp(22px,5vw,72px) 120px}.toc{grid-column:1;align-self:start;position:sticky;top:90px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.toc>span{font:500 12px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--violet);margin-bottom:14px}.toc>a{font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#919bb5;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(39,49,73,.55)}.toc>a:hover{color:var(--ink)}.article-body{grid-column:2;min-width:0}.article-body>h1:first-of-type{display:none}.article-body>p:first-of-type{font-size:22px;line-height:1.58;color:#d5dbef;margin:0 0 32px}.article-body h2{font:600 37px/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:86px 0 25px;scroll-margin-top:90px}.article-body h3{font:600 23px/1.25 var(--serif);margin:42px 0 12px;color:#f0f2ff}.article-body p{color:#b9c1d5;margin:0 0 24px}.article-body strong{color:#f1f3ff;font-weight:600}.article-body a{color:var(--cyan);text-decoration-color:rgba(134,210,255,.32);text-underline-offset:3px}.article-body a:hover{text-decoration-color:var(--cyan)}.article-body ul,.article-body ol{padding-left:24px;margin:0 0 28px;color:#b9c1d5}.article-body ul{list-style:disc}.article-body ol{list-style:decimal}.article-body li{padding-left:7px;margin:9px 0}.article-body li::marker{color:var(--violet)}.article-body code{font:400 .86em/1 var(--mono);color:#c9e7ff;background:#121d32;border:1px solid #2a3750;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 5px}
  .truth-note{display:block;margin:38px 0;padding:23px 25px;border:1px solid rgba(128,131,255,.35);border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(128,131,255,.11),rgba(18,29,50,.5))}.truth-note strong{display:block;font:600 15px/1.3 var(--serif);color:var(--violet)}.truth-note p{margin:8px 0 0!important;font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.58!important;color:#b8c2da!important}
  .system-figure{margin:48px 0 58px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#0b1527;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.figure-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:17px 21px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.figure-heading span{font:500 12px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--violet)}.figure-heading b{font:600 14px/1.35 var(--serif)}.system-figure figcaption{padding:15px 21px 18px;color:#929cb5;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px;line-height:1.55}
  .sequence-shell{padding:25px}.input-state{padding:16px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(134,210,255,.4);border-radius:8px;background:rgba(134,210,255,.07)}.input-state small,.batch-node small{display:block;font:500 12px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--cyan)}.input-state strong{display:block;margin-top:10px;font:600 15px/1.3 var(--serif)}.sequence-list{display:grid;gap:7px;margin:18px 0}.sequence-list>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:76px 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:center}.sequence-list .type{padding:9px 6px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #4b5288;border-radius:5px;background:#19243f;color:#c9cbff;font:500 12px/1 var(--mono)}.sequence-list .score{border-color:#3d6572;background:#122b35;color:#a5dfef}.sequence-list .noul{border-color:#615046;background:#292027;color:#ffc6a3}.sequence-list code{display:block;white-space:normal;padding:10px 12px;color:#9ca8c1;background:#101b2e;border-color:#2b3852;font-size:12px}.batch-node{text-align:center;padding:18px;border:1px solid rgba(128,131,255,.55);border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(128,131,255,.13),#111d31)}.batch-node small{color:var(--violet)}.batch-node strong{display:block;margin:10px 0 3px;font:600 17px/1.2 var(--serif)}.batch-node span{font:400 12px/1 var(--mono);color:#8390aa}.pipeline-arrow{height:28px;text-align:center;color:#5e6a86;line-height:28px}.head-flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 18px 1fr 18px 1fr;align-items:stretch}.head-flow>div{padding:14px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(134,210,255,.4);border-radius:7px;background:rgba(134,210,255,.06)}.head-flow>i{display:grid;place-items:center;color:#5e6a86;font-style:normal}.head-flow small{display:block;color:var(--cyan);font:500 12px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em}.head-flow strong{display:block;margin-top:9px;font:600 13px/1.35 var(--serif)}
  .primitive-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px;margin:38px 0}.primitive-grid>div{padding:21px 17px;border:1px solid #2d3a55;border-radius:9px;background:#0f1a2d}.primitive-grid small{font:500 12px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--violet)}.primitive-grid strong{display:block;font:600 15px/1.3 var(--serif);margin:14px 0 8px}.primitive-grid p{font-size:14px!important;line-height:1.5!important;margin:0!important;color:#929eb8!important}
  .train-infer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;padding:24px}.train-infer section{padding:19px;border:1px solid #2d3a55;border-radius:9px;background:#0f1a2d}.train-infer small{display:block;margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--violet);font:500 12px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em}.train-infer section>div{padding:11px 13px;border:1px solid #35425d;border-radius:6px;color:#aeb7cc;background:#111d31;font:500 13px/1.35 var(--mono)}.train-infer section>i{display:block;height:22px;text-align:center;color:#5e6a86;font-style:normal}.train-infer section>.accent{border-color:rgba(134,210,255,.45);color:#b7e6ff;background:rgba(134,210,255,.07)}
  .evidence-table{width:100%;table-layout:fixed;margin:38px 0;border:1px solid #2d3a55;border-spacing:0;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#0f1a2d;text-align:left}.evidence-table caption{padding:0 0 11px;color:#929cb5;text-align:left;font-size:14px}.evidence-table th,.evidence-table td{padding:13px 15px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;border-bottom:1px solid #2b3852;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.evidence-table th{color:#98a3bc;background:#111d31;font:500 12px/1.3 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em}.evidence-table th:nth-child(1){width:26%}.evidence-table th:nth-child(2){width:24%}.evidence-table tbody tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}.evidence-table strong{color:var(--cyan);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px}
  .workflow-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 18px 1fr 18px 1fr 18px 1fr;align-items:stretch;margin:42px 0}.workflow-line>div{padding:17px 13px;border:1px solid #2d3a55;border-radius:8px;background:#0f1a2d}.workflow-line>i{display:grid;place-items:center;color:#5a6782;font-style:normal}.workflow-line small{font:500 12px/1 var(--mono);color:#7d89a4}.workflow-line strong{display:block;font:600 14px/1.25 var(--serif);margin:13px 0 6px}.workflow-line span{font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#8e9ab4}.workflow-line .accent{border-color:rgba(128,131,255,.58);background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(128,131,255,.13),#101b2e)}.workflow-line .accent small,.workflow-line .accent strong{color:#c4c6ff}
  .recommendation-box{position:relative;overflow:hidden;margin:38px 0 56px;padding:27px 29px 24px;border:1px solid rgba(134,210,255,.42);border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(124,128,255,.15),rgba(134,210,255,.07) 62%,rgba(13,23,41,.85));box-shadow:inset 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.04)}.recommendation-box:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:3px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--cyan),var(--violet-2))}.article-body .recommendation-box h3{margin:0 0 17px;color:#dfe1ff;font:600 23px/1.25 var(--serif)}.article-body .recommendation-box ul{margin:0;padding-left:21px;color:#c3cbe0}.article-body .recommendation-box li{margin:10px 0;padding-left:5px;line-height:1.55}.article-body .recommendation-box li::marker{color:var(--cyan)}
  .closing{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:95px clamp(22px,5vw,72px);text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,rgba(128,131,255,.12),transparent 52%)}.closing>span{font:500 10px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--violet)}.closing h2{font:600 clamp(34px,5vw,57px)/1.1 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.035em;max-width:850px;margin:20px auto}.closing p{max-width:610px;margin:0 auto 34px;color:var(--muted)}.closing a{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:var(--violet-2);color:#090f20;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:8px}.closing a span{margin-left:8px}
  @media(max-width:1000px){.hero{min-height:690px}.hero-wash{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#08101f 0%,rgba(8,16,31,.88) 60%,rgba(8,16,31,.3)),linear-gradient(0deg,#08101f 0%,transparent 55%)}.page-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:60px}.toc{display:none}.article-body{grid-column:1}.signal-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr}.signal-strip>div+div{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:0}}
  @media(max-width:640px){:scope{font-size:16px}.hero{min-height:720px}.hero-inner{padding-top:76px;padding-bottom:58px}.hero h1{font-size:43px}.hero-copy>p{font-size:17px}.signal-strip>div{padding:24px 0}.page-grid{padding-bottom:80px}.article-body h2{font-size:31px;margin-top:68px}.article-body h3{font-size:21px}.article-body>p:first-of-type{font-size:19px}.sequence-shell{padding:15px}.sequence-list>div{grid-template-columns:1fr}.head-flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.head-flow>i{height:22px;transform:rotate(90deg)}.primitive-grid,.train-infer{grid-template-columns:1fr}.train-infer{padding:15px}.evidence-table th,.evidence-table td{padding:10px 6px}.workflow-line{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workflow-line>i{height:22px;transform:rotate(90deg)}.recommendation-box{margin-bottom:46px;padding:23px 20px 20px}.article-body .recommendation-box h3{font-size:21px}}
  }
</style>
